  "title": "Jan L Probable NDE 3968",
  "date": "September 1969",
  "content": "I was given a general anesthetic for a routine surgical procedure for my bladder. Once the anesthetic was given to me, and procedure completed, while in the recovery room attendants and doctors could not awaken me. And so on. During this time I recall looking around the recovery room and eventually, sitting up and moving. Being curious, I looked around the room to see what it looked like noticing the medical staff working in another portion of the room. Suddenly, I saw this beautiful white light slowly coming towards me. A man who had a kind gentle face dressed in a white cloth was before me. He stood to the right side of this ever-growing light. While I began to move in his direction, he was so welcoming and only spoke to me it seemed through his eyes. He asked me if I wanted to enter the light. I was overjoyed that he had come for me and loved me so much. I can't really describe the joy or calm I felt. I wanted to go with so badly. It felt like home. Somehow it was decided for me not to go with him and I returned to my body.",
